; ========================================
; ＞『地精の間』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走进招待所之中<br>处于最外侧的【地精之室】。|#0103Adv22_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:由于火灾并未波及这里，<br>房间仍保持着原样。|#0103Adv22_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在里面，<br>艾玛遇到了躺在床上的可可。|#0103Adv22_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可可，你在这里做什么……？|#0103Adv22_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……啊，是艾玛亲啊……<br>那个，我睡眠不足嘛……|#0103Adv22_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想在审判开始之前，<br>稍微睡一会。|#0103Adv22_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我还以为她去调查了呢……）|#0103Adv22_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Normal1,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:我也是想调查来着。<br>但是现场实在不太想看。|#0103Adv22_Coco003| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后呢，我本来想调查其他房间的，<br>结果看到了这张舒服的床。|#0103Adv22_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……|#0103Adv22_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，什么眼神啊，好烦。<br>睡觉又不犯法，你别管我了！|#0103Adv22_Coco005| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:可可一脸不高兴地转过身去睡了。<br>|#0103Adv22_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可可已经指望不上了……<br>　我还是做我该做的事吧）|#0103Adv22_Ema004|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛开始仔细搜查室内。|#0103Adv22_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然这里不是杀人现场，<br>　可能没什么意义……）|#0103Adv22_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这个房间，被翻乱了……？<br>　虽然应该不是可可干的……<br>　这到底怎么回事……？）|#0103Adv22_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，她发现了有一样东西掉在了地上。|#0103Adv22_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; ☆証拠品：『アリサの人形』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:3-8
@UpdateWitchBook Id:3-8 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（亚里沙的人偶……！<br>　是汉娜做的吗？）|#0103Adv22_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛想看现场还有没有线索，<br>但经过一番搜寻，没有发现什么特别的东西。|#0103Adv22_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（时间不多了，去调查其他地方吧）|#0103Adv22_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:离开房间时，<br>艾玛回头看了可可一眼。|#0103Adv22_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……她每天晚上都在说梦话吵得不行，<br>最近还总是歇斯底里地闹……<br>现在她不在了反而落得清静。|#0103Adv22_Coco006| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:装睡的可可的背影，<br>似乎在微微颤抖。|#0103Adv22_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

